        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia 7036/0, Rectangular Flush Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe 4-1/2 Inch Rectangular Flush Pull is available in a wide array of finishes. Its modern design will suit almost any home, making it a great choice for remodelers and designers alike. The Rectangular Flush Pull is easy to install and comes packaged with the mounting hardware.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available Matching: <a href=\"/products/4-1-2-inch-pocket-door-privacy-set-omnia-7036-l\"><b>Privacy Set</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Modern Sliding Door Trim:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Plate Height: 4-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Width: 2-9/32\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Cut-Out Height: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Cut-Out Width: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Projection: 3/32\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Depth: 3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Non-handed</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/OMN-7036-specifications.pdf?v=1704262370\"><b>Omnia 7036 Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold Individually:</b> one (1) rectangle flush pull and all mounting hardware. <b>For One Side of (1) Door.</b>\r\n</p>",
